   "text": "This page contains the decklists of Avatar: The Last Airbender Jumpstart packs that consist primarily of blue cards.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Due to a late production change, two blue packets— Adaptive and Lessons (1) —were printed with the white card Glider Kids included. Unless a player happens to get a white Jumpstart Booster theme to go with it, the card is uncastable from its own packet alone. Wizards of the Coast issued a statement that players who encounter these packets are encouraged to either treat Glider Kids as if it were castable with blue mana or discard it and draw their next card.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
